!!!!!!!!!!!!!!  CLARA linear-taper input deck  !!!!!!!!!!!!!!
!!
!!  Cut down from inputs/simple/1D/osc-linear-taper/shorter.
!!
!!  1D, but driven from a lattice file, so unlike the other 1D test
!!  (inputs/f1main.in) this exercises the multi-element path: five
!!  undulator modules with undulator ends and a linear taper
!!  (d/dz alpha = 0.14), separated by drift / chicane / quad triples.
!!  5 modules x 29 periods x 30 steps = 4350 integration steps.
!!
!!  The seed field is zero, so the interaction starts from the beam's
!!  shot noise. The beam is therefore read from a committed HDF5 file
!!  (see osc_taper_beam.in) rather than generated at runtime: Puffin's
!!  shot noise comes from the intrinsic RANDOM_NUMBER, whose stream is
!!  compiler- and version-specific, so a runtime-generated beam would
!!  differ between the machine the golden files were made on and CI.
!!
!!  iRandSeed below is belt and braces only -- with the beam read from
!!  file nothing should be drawing from the RNG at all. It is the frozen
!!  beam, not this, that makes the run reproducible.
!!
!!  Reproducibility is still tied to the rank count, because the beam is
!!  distributed over ranks on read (2, matching npes in
!!  testMPIIntegration1DTaper.pf).
!!
!!  iWriteNthSteps / iWriteIntNthSteps are left far beyond the run
!!  length so the only dumps are the initial one, the end of the first
!!  undulator module, and the final qDumpEnd write.
!!
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

&MDATA
 qScaled                = .false.
 qOneD                  = .true.
 qFieldEvolve           = .true.
 qElectronsEvolve       = .true.
 qElectronFieldCoupling = .true.
 qFocussing             = .false.
 qDiffraction           = .true.
 qsdds                  = .false.
 qhdf5                  = .true.
 qUndEnds               = .true.
 qFMesh_G               = .false.
 qfilter                = .true.
 beam_file              = 'inputs/1D/osc_taper_beam.in'
 sElectronThreshold     = 0.05
 meshType               = 1
 iNumNodesX             = 85
 iNumNodesY             = 85
 nodesPerLambdar        = 21
 sFModelLengthX         = 0.0016677689533916074
 sFModelLengthY         = 0.0016677689533916074
 sFModelLengthZ2        = 2.08477559498845e-16
 iRedNodesX             = 21
 iRedNodesY             = 21
 sFiltFrac              = 0.3
 sDiffFrac              = 1.0
 sBeta                  = 0.5
 seed_file              = 'inputs/1D/osc_taper_seed.in'
 srho                   = 0.001
 saw                    = 1.414216
 sgamma_r               = 8000.0
 lambda_w               = 0.04
 zundType               = 'planepole'
 lattFile               = 'inputs/1D/osc_taper.latt'
 iRandSeed              = 20260817
 stepsPerPeriod         = 30
 nPeriods               = 5
 sZ0                    = 0.0
 iWriteNthSteps         = 30000
 iWriteIntNthSteps      = 30000
 sRedistLen             = 0.25
 iRedistStp             = 10
 /
